{"key":"moonbitlang/async/gzip.Decoder.drop:Method","pkg":"moonbitlang/async/gzip","name":"drop","parent":"moonbitlang/async/gzip.Decoder","kind":"method","sig_":"pub async fn[R : @io.Reader] Decoder::drop(Self[R], Int) -> Int","doc":"`reader.drop(len)` drops `len` number of bytes from the reader.\n The number of bytes actually dropped is returned.\n `drop` will wait until enough number of bytes is available,\n so the return value would be smaller than `len` only when EOF is reached.","attrs":[]}
