{"key":"moonbitlang/async/js_async.ReadableStream.from_js:Method","pkg":"moonbitlang/async/js_async","name":"from_js","parent":"moonbitlang/async/js_async.ReadableStream","kind":"method","sig_":"pub fn ReadableStream::from_js(JsReadableStream) -> Self","doc":"Create a `ReadableStream` wrapper from a `JsReadableStream` object,\n in order to read the content of the stream from the MoonBit side.\n The ownership of the JS stream will be transferred to the `ReadableStream`:\n other code cannot read the stream anymore.","attrs":[]}
