{"key":"moonbitlang/async/internal/gzip_internal.Decoder.minimum_input_size:Method","pkg":"moonbitlang/async/internal/gzip_internal","name":"minimum_input_size","parent":"moonbitlang/async/internal/gzip_internal.Decoder","kind":"method","sig_":"pub fn Decoder::minimum_input_size(Self) -> Int","doc":"Return the minimum compressed input required for\n the next `write` call to make any progress.\n The caller may provide more than this amount.","attrs":[]}
