{"key":"moonbitlang/async/js_async.ReadableStream.read:Method","pkg":"moonbitlang/async/js_async","name":"read","parent":"moonbitlang/async/js_async.ReadableStream","kind":"method","sig_":"pub async fn ReadableStream::read(Self, FixedArray[Byte], offset? : Int, max_len? : Int) -> Int","doc":"`reader.read(dst, offset~, max_len~)` read at most `max_len` bytes from the reader,\n storing the result in `dst[offset:]`.\n The number of bytes actually read is returned.\n Note that the return value may be smaller than `max_len`\n if not enough data is *immediately* available.\n If EOF is reached and no more data is available, zero will be returned.","attrs":[]}
