{"key":"moonbitlang/async.with_timeout","pkg":"moonbitlang/async","name":"with_timeout","parent":"moonbitlang/async","kind":"function","sig_":"pub async fn[X] with_timeout(Int, async () -> X, error? : Error) -> X","doc":"`with_timeout(timeout, f)` run the async function `f`.\n\n - If `f` return `value` before `timeout`,\n   `with_timeout` will return `value` immediately.\n\n - If `f` fail before `timeout`, `with_timeout` will fail immediately.\n\n - If `f` is still running after `timeout` milliseconds,\n   `with_timeout` will fail with `TimeoutError`,\n   or the value of `error`, if explicitly specified.","attrs":[]}
{"key":"moonbitlang/async/internal/bytes_util","pkg":"moonbitlang/async/internal/bytes_util","name":"moonbitlang/async/internal/bytes_util","parent":null,"kind":"package","sig_":null,"doc":null,"attrs":[]}
{"key":"moonbitlang/async/gzip.Decoder.read_until:Method","pkg":"moonbitlang/async/gzip","name":"read_until","parent":"moonbitlang/async/gzip.Decoder","kind":"method","sig_":"pub async fn[R : @io.Reader] Decoder::read_until(Self[R], StringView) -> String?","doc":"`reader.read_until(sep)` read UTF-8 encoded text from the input stream\n until `sep` or EOF is reached.\n The segment of input from start of reader to start of `sep` or EOF is returned.\n `sep` will be conusmed from the input, but is not included in the return value.","attrs":[]}
