{"key":"moonbitlang/async.now","pkg":"moonbitlang/async","name":"now","parent":"moonbitlang/async","kind":"function","sig_":"pub fn now() -> Int64","doc":"Get current time, measured in milliseconds.\n `now` uses the same clock as timers in `moonbitlang/async`.\n\n `now` can be used to measure elapsed time, such as benchmarking,\n but the meaning of the absolute time value returned by `now`\n is undefined, and should not be depended on.","attrs":[]}
