{"key":"moonbitlang/async/aqueue.Queue.try_get:Method","pkg":"moonbitlang/async/aqueue","name":"try_get","parent":"moonbitlang/async/aqueue.Queue","kind":"method","sig_":"pub fn[X] Queue::try_get(Self[X]) -> X? raise","doc":"Try to fetch an element from the queue without blocking.\n If no element is in the queue at the moment, `None` is returned.\n\n If the queue is already closed and there is no buffered elements,\n `try_get` will fail immediately.","attrs":[]}
